"你用连贯的乐句传递出月夜的静谧与流动，已初见意境；继续用心去“唱”这根弦，情感会更饱满。" = "You convey the stillness and flow of the moonlit night with connected phrases—already evocative; keep \"singing\" the string and the feeling will deepen.";
"《十面埋伏》气势磅礴，再现楚汉垓下之战的紧张与锋芒。" = "Ambush from Ten Sides is majestic, reviving the tension and edge of the Gaixia battle.";
"你在激越处爆发张力、在收束处懂得克制，已触摸到这首武曲的精气神，气势越来越足。" = "You unleash tension at climaxes and restrain at endings—you've touched this war piece's spirit; the power keeps growing.";
"《霸王卸甲》同写楚汉相争，却从项羽视角刻画英雄末路的苍凉与悲壮。" = "The King Unarms also depicts the Chu–Han struggle, but from Xiang Yu's view—the desolation and tragedy of a hero's end.";
"你在慢板里注入了难得的沉静与悲悯，把英雄末路的情绪慢慢讲清楚了，这份共情很打动人。" = "You bring rare calm and compassion to the slow movement, telling the hero's end with feeling—that empathy is moving.";
